      "role": "user",
      "content": "the walls are literally crumbling... everything is just gone. i dont even know why we're still sitting here waiting for them to break through. it feels like there is no way out of this besides just... letting it happen. is there even a point in trying to fight it anymore? or is it better to just find a way to meet it on my own terms?",
